      "chunk_id": null,
      "contains_speech": true,
      "content": "Here are the available flight options for your one-way trip from New York (JFK) to Seattle (SEA) on May 20, 2024:\n\n### Direct Flights:\n1. **Flight HAT069**\n   - Departure: 06:00 AM (JFK)\n   - Arrival: 12:00 PM (SEA)\n   - Economy Price: $121\n   - Available Seats: 12\n\n2. **Flight HAT083**\n   - Departure: 01:00 AM (JFK)\n   - Arrival: 07:00 AM (SEA)\n   - Economy Price: $100\n   - Available Seats: 7\n\n### One-Stop Flights:\nAll one-stop flights involve a stop in Atlanta (ATL) and have the following details:\n- First Leg (JFK to ATL):\n  - Departure: 07:00 AM to 19:00 PM (varies)\n  - Arrival: 09:30 AM to 21:30 PM (varies)\n- Second Leg (ATL to SEA):\n  - Departure: 10:00 PM\n  - Arrival: 03:00 AM (next day)\n  - Economy Price: $103\n- Total Economy Price: $244 (first leg price + second leg price)\n\nPlease note:\n- You are traveling in economy class.\n- You have three pieces of luggage.\n- As a gold member, you are entitled to 3 free checked bags per passenger for economy class.\n- Since you have three pieces of luggage, no additional charge will apply.\n\nWould you like to proceed with booking one of these options? If so, please confirm which flight you'd like to book.",
